        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE: Layoff, sick leave, authorized leave of absence, other authorized absence that lasts 30 days or less, and military service during periods of national emergency are not considered termination of your employment. You keep all benefits under the Retirement Plan if you return to work from these leaves within a specified period of time.",
